  "interpretation": "AI removed most filled activity and reduced marked returns below unchanged baseline and predeclared primary suppression in both base execution modes. Improved mean closed R rests on the same single Fib EMA 15m candidate under alternative execution policies, not independent wins. Conditional sensitivity rankings are mixed. Adverse IOC missed the sole filled opportunity; adverse maker is inactive in every arm. No promotion or trading permission.",
  "semantic_spotcheck": "The two repeated known anchor-clock context errors are not repeated; numerical anchor low 41910.6 versus later minimum 41939.1 supports the new context reasons. Both remain abstentions. Only targeted development spot-checks, not an exhaustive truth audit or a controlled backend/instruction attribution.",
  "cost_note": "Net financial values include simulated trading costs. Native subscription quota/tokens are reported separately; no invented Platform-dollar inference cost is deducted.",
  "limitations": [
    "Fixed two-day repeatedly inspected development data, 16 dependent setup/timeframe cases, few fills and historical model-pretraining contamination.",
    "Conditional hash controls match arm permissions, not fills; their future-total conditioning makes them nondeployable references, not a causal randomized trading trial.",
    "Actual latency mapped per independent case with assumed 1s native-bar delivery; no shared inference queue, historical OKX books/queues/fill probabilities or historical fee/rule evidence.",
    "Native opinions remain unchanged; structural validation does not establish semantic truth.",
    "Lower losses with reduced activity, undefined closed R or flat adverse maker execution do not establish incremental AI value or robustness.",
    "All executions and fees simulated; retained BTC marked, not fictionally liquidated. Subscription usage reported without unapproved Platform-dollar price conversion."
  ],
